Nova-App: Nova Browser
Nova-News: Optimierung und Stabilitätsverbesserung: weicheres Scrollen, bei vielen Tabs wird Speicher schneller frei, Videos über die Grafikkarte
Nova-News-En: Optimisation and stability improvements: smoother scrolling, memory freed sooner with many tabs, videos on the graphics card
Description: Nova Browser - Firefox with the NovaOS settings
 Privacy, speed and stability settings of Nova Browser (Firefox ESR): tracker
 blocking, HTTPS-only mode, no telemetry, inactive tabs unloaded when memory is
 low, hardware video decoding and fewer disk writes. The Nova Store shows
 updates of this package as "Nova Browser" with "Aktualisieren".
